  m_text: "Welcome to the Mixed Reality Fire Safety Training Simulation.\r\n\r\nWithin
    this experience, we are going to start a fire, create and sound the alarm, and
    practice extinguishing the fire. Before we start, please ensure you're in a safe
    and open space, free from obstacles. \r\n\r\nIf at any point you feel uncomfortable
    or dizzy, you may remove your headset and exit the simulation. Now, let's start
    a fire. \r\n"
