  m_text: "So to revisit one last time, that's: \r\n\r\n<color=#00ffff>P</color=#00ffff>ull
    the pin, \r\n<color=#00ffff>A</color=#00ffff>im at the base of the fire, \r\n<color=#00ffff>S</color=#00ffff>queeze
    the handle, \n<color=#00ffff>S</color=#00ffff>weep the nozzle from side to side.
    \r\n\r\nThink <color=#00ffff>PASS</color=#00ffff> to pass the fire."
